		{"id":"f4fffaca8b009766","type":"text","text":"Future","x":-398,"y":844,"width":102,"height":60},
		{"id":"f3c1c6abbbdd8f88","type":"text","text":"potentially, we may add start and end of continuous / stative. these will be special forms of aorist, like \"побежал, добежал\"","x":1020,"y":1020,"width":762,"height":57},
		{"id":"fea07f285a3b930d","type":"text","text":"aorist is used for single, instantaneous and perceived as indivisible action","x":1020,"y":1100,"width":762,"height":60},
		{"id":"9edfe83d618d3f77","type":"text","text":"additional verbs is used without tense only with their aspect from.","x":1020,"y":1180,"width":762,"height":60},
		{"id":"8f75dedc0f8a3a45","type":"text","text":"modal verbs, like 'must', 'should', etc., are used in stative or aorist, for example: \"могу\",  / \"мог\" \"смог\"","x":1020,"y":1263,"width":762,"height":60},
		{"id":"03562501703b19af","type":"text","text":"для непреложных истин используют настоящие время, то есть статив + наст., потому что они неприложны только сейчас ","x":1020,"y":1357,"width":762,"height":60}
	],
